{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"加性范畴"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"加性范畴"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>加性范畴是有有限"},{"Local":{"url":"和(范畴论)","text":"余积"}},{"Plain":"的 $\\mathsf {Ab}$-"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Abel范畴","text":"Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}